{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864700/extras/6626bb581d464f90bc36451311fca766.webp?t=1763947673\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polesie was once a peaceful region in Eastern Europe. Now it's a nightmare where succubi roam freely and most of the male population has transformed into ravenous ghouls. As one of  survivors, scavenge, craft, and fight to uncover the origins of the deadzone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864700/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.poster.avif?t=1763947673\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864700/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.webm?t=1763947673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864700/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.mp4?t=1763947673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore abandoned settlements and facilities</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for vital resources and equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons, tools, and survival gear to stay alive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade resources and rare items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research and unlock new technologies to gain an edge</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle succubi, ghouls, and other creatures</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade 